# The server image is built from the repository root, because it shares three modules and the console's
# source with the agent. Everything is left out except what is named here: the agent folder holds personal
# data (search.db, logs, config.yaml, a 400 MB cve.db) that must never reach an image.
*
!server/
!shadow-filer/cve.py
!shadow-filer/eol.py
!shadow-filer/compliance.py
!device-agent/release.py
!shadow-filer/ui/
shadow-filer/ui/node_modules
server/local-keys.txt
server/.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
